184
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:33,680
He's a man.

185
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:36,340
Or if she is a woman, a Filipina.

186
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:41,360
So this is very similar to the Spanish structure of having a gender on the end of the word.

187
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:42,200
That's right.

188
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:46,980
